WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.000
[English subtitles are available]

01:31.430 --> 01:40.120
[Song of the Moon]

01:40.120 --> 01:42.990
[Episode 16]

01:48.500 --> 01:51.360
Tomorrow, I'll set up a magic circle under Lusitai.

01:52.250 --> 01:53.700
And use Liu Shao's flesh

01:54.020 --> 01:55.550
to refine the Blood Amulet.

01:57.860 --> 01:59.170
I'm willing to help you

01:59.460 --> 02:00.210
to protect the magic circle.

02:00.210 --> 02:01.780
No one is allowed to go near Lusitai

02:01.780 --> 02:02.940
for three days.

02:03.860 --> 02:05.020
Yes.

02:09.250 --> 02:10.259
No way.

02:10.620 --> 02:12.060
Is it true that Immortal Luo Ge

02:12.060 --> 02:14.990
is going to use your flesh to refine the Blood Amulet?

02:15.570 --> 02:16.260
Yes.

02:16.410 --> 02:17.450
Why?

02:17.650 --> 02:19.100
Restoring the Four Seasons Monument is so important.

02:19.100 --> 02:20.579
You are too weak to bear it.

02:21.380 --> 02:23.940
It is said that I have the Power of the Sun.

02:24.170 --> 02:26.780
The Four Seasons Monument was sealed by God of the Sun.

02:26.780 --> 02:28.510
Of course I have to contribute.

02:32.340 --> 02:34.000
To contribute with your life?

02:34.579 --> 02:35.579
Exactly.

02:37.940 --> 02:39.500
I only have one life.

02:40.140 --> 02:41.100
Who would like to

02:41.260 --> 02:42.590
risk their lives to bet?

02:42.900 --> 02:43.930
Of course.

02:45.260 --> 02:46.060
To bet on what?

02:48.740 --> 02:49.420
To bet

02:49.860 --> 02:51.140
that Luo Ge

02:51.500 --> 02:53.230
is still that Lu Li who loves me,

02:54.100 --> 02:55.300
and doesn't want me to die.

02:55.300 --> 02:56.180
But...

02:57.100 --> 02:58.340
what if he is really willing

02:58.340 --> 03:00.740
to fill the Four Seasons Monument with you?

03:11.500 --> 03:12.180
Liu Shao,

03:13.660 --> 03:15.060
have you made up your mind?

03:15.060 --> 03:16.520
The seven talisman pearls

03:16.700 --> 03:18.100
are related to your soul.

03:20.740 --> 03:21.980
If I said no,

03:22.860 --> 03:24.420
would Immortal Palace give up

03:24.420 --> 03:25.820
taking my blood

03:26.500 --> 03:27.740
or would you give up

03:28.060 --> 03:29.460
refining amulet with me?

03:29.620 --> 03:31.750
Neither would Immortal Palace nor me.

03:33.460 --> 03:35.460
Although I have the Power of the Sun,

03:35.610 --> 03:36.980
I never hurt anyone.

03:37.900 --> 03:39.900
Whether it's Immortal Palace or you

03:40.100 --> 03:41.300
filling the monument

03:42.579 --> 03:43.780
with my blood

03:44.900 --> 03:46.230
is both a betrayal of me.

03:48.100 --> 03:48.650
Yes.

03:50.700 --> 03:52.100
It's me who betrayed you.

03:52.579 --> 03:54.420
It's not Immortal Luo Ge who betrayed me,

03:54.420 --> 03:55.220
but you,

03:55.900 --> 03:57.740
the man standing in front of me.

03:58.420 --> 04:00.680
Not only did you fail to keep your promise

04:01.740 --> 04:03.740
to protect me for the rest of my life,

04:03.940 --> 04:04.610
but you also

04:05.860 --> 04:07.060
hurt me, betrayed me,

04:08.260 --> 04:10.390
and used my blood to fill the monument.

04:10.700 --> 04:12.700
Lu Li is the one who promised you, not me.

04:12.700 --> 04:13.650
You are Lu Li.

04:13.740 --> 04:15.870
There's no such a person in this world.

04:16.370 --> 04:17.500
Then just tell me,

04:18.820 --> 04:20.779
who is that affectionate Lu Li

04:20.779 --> 04:21.940
who would cry, laugh,

04:21.940 --> 04:23.540
and would sacrifice his life

04:24.340 --> 04:26.740
because of a little obsession in his heart?

04:29.980 --> 04:31.110
Even if he did exist,

04:32.940 --> 04:34.260
he's long dead by now.

04:54.140 --> 04:55.340
Now that Lu Li is dead,

04:56.220 --> 04:57.700
I will keep my promise

04:57.940 --> 04:59.300
to die with him.

05:00.700 --> 05:01.820
I hope I can still

05:03.580 --> 05:05.510
catch up with him in the other world

05:05.860 --> 05:07.180
and still get to see

05:08.380 --> 05:09.330
his beating

05:11.010 --> 05:12.500
moon-shaped heart.

06:14.740 --> 06:15.780
Lu Li...

06:17.810 --> 06:18.940
Wait for me.

06:47.100 --> 06:49.820
The restoration of the Four Seasons Monument has begun.

06:49.820 --> 06:50.540
Looks like

06:50.700 --> 06:52.700
those talisman pearls are working.

06:53.300 --> 06:54.180
That's great.

06:54.810 --> 06:55.780
What a good news.

06:56.260 --> 06:57.260
Isn't this migic circle

06:57.260 --> 06:59.659
being hosted by Immortal Luo Ge all the time?

06:59.659 --> 07:02.260
Why did I just see him go back to Xiyin Mountain?

07:03.140 --> 07:04.660
It can run on its own

07:04.660 --> 07:06.460
without being hosted by others.

07:07.980 --> 07:08.780
I'm leaving.

07:08.860 --> 07:10.060
I'll go back to wash up

07:10.100 --> 07:11.100
and go to bed.

07:30.580 --> 07:32.580
The person who looks the same as Lu Li

07:33.300 --> 07:34.820
is no longer the caring

07:35.770 --> 07:37.100
and affectionate Lu Li.

07:37.780 --> 07:38.840
It seemed that Lu Li

07:40.380 --> 07:41.580
was really gone.

09:09.660 --> 09:10.920
So you are the traitor.

09:11.820 --> 09:13.340
I will tell you all this

09:14.220 --> 09:16.280
with paper money from the human world

09:16.580 --> 09:18.580
on the seventh day after your death.

09:35.700 --> 09:36.570
Immortal?

09:37.010 --> 09:38.620
What else

09:40.060 --> 09:41.420
do you have to say now?

09:41.980 --> 09:43.180
I just don't want you

09:44.180 --> 09:46.110
to be seduced by this mortal woman.

09:46.140 --> 09:47.820
So I destroyed her flesh

09:48.130 --> 09:50.060
and left her divine spirit for you.

09:50.140 --> 09:51.470
Even without her flesh,

09:51.980 --> 09:55.840
you can still use her divine spirit to refine the Blood Amulet, right?

09:56.940 --> 09:58.260
How can I make it

09:59.020 --> 10:00.420
without her flesh?

10:01.620 --> 10:03.060
You are still playing fool,

10:03.060 --> 10:04.020
Xie Lingqi?

10:05.570 --> 10:08.260
You can execute me

10:08.700 --> 10:09.830
to test my innocence

10:10.740 --> 10:12.020
if you still have doubts about me.

10:12.020 --> 10:12.940
You have been wrapped in demon aura.

10:12.940 --> 10:13.980
Why are you still in denial?

10:13.980 --> 10:15.180
Take a good look at it.

10:16.220 --> 10:19.900
You really think the Protection Spell you broke into is a Blood Amulet magic circle,

10:19.900 --> 10:21.020
and you are still

10:21.540 --> 10:22.820
on Lusitai?

11:06.500 --> 11:07.420
Ge.

11:07.590 --> 11:08.810
Didn't you say that this time

11:08.810 --> 11:11.860
you could escort the spy of the Demons back to Litian Temple?

11:11.860 --> 11:14.860
But why did you use the Star Teleportation spell

11:15.900 --> 11:17.360
to bring General Xie here?

11:19.530 --> 11:20.130
Immortal.

11:20.700 --> 11:21.700
Immortal Master.

11:21.980 --> 11:22.420
I...

11:22.820 --> 11:23.860
I'm innocent.

11:24.300 --> 11:26.060
From Protection Spell being damaged

11:26.060 --> 11:27.790
to Ziji Shield being exploited

11:28.370 --> 11:29.580
to Bone-Corroding Harp's demon voice

11:29.580 --> 11:32.740
hitting the cracks of Four Seasons Monument straight on.

11:32.740 --> 11:33.410
So,

11:34.380 --> 11:36.500
Ao Hen knew where the Ziji Shield was,

11:37.220 --> 11:39.460
and knew which part of the Four Seasons Monument was the weakest.

11:39.460 --> 11:40.180
Exactly.

11:40.740 --> 11:41.700
So I was sure

11:43.140 --> 11:44.970
that she had colluded with someone here.

11:44.970 --> 11:46.770
So I deliberately told everyone

11:48.060 --> 11:50.660
that I would use Liu Shao's blood to refine the talisman pearl

11:50.660 --> 11:52.790
to restore the Four Seasons Monument.

11:53.300 --> 11:54.260
All I know is

11:54.540 --> 11:56.780
that Liu Shao has agreed to use her flesh to refine the talisman pearl

11:56.780 --> 11:58.740
in order to restore the Four Seasons Monument.

11:58.740 --> 12:00.670
I did all these just to lure you out.

12:01.340 --> 12:03.340
You have been wrapped in demon aura.

12:03.500 --> 12:04.700
What else can you say?

12:05.940 --> 12:08.140
I've been killing demons in the Three Realms,

12:08.140 --> 12:11.260
so it's inevitable that I would be contaminated with some demonic aura.

12:11.260 --> 12:12.060
You're right.

12:12.820 --> 12:13.940
I really can't stand

12:13.940 --> 12:14.860
Liu Shao

12:14.900 --> 12:15.900
and hate her.

12:16.100 --> 12:17.060
I admit it all.

12:17.660 --> 12:18.900
But you have no right to say

12:18.900 --> 12:20.780
that I colluded with the demon world and tried to destroy Immortal Palace

12:20.780 --> 12:22.780
on the basis of this incident alone.

12:23.580 --> 12:24.220
Immortal.

12:24.580 --> 12:26.340
General Xie, as the guardian of the monument,

12:26.340 --> 12:28.380
has been in the Immortal Palace for more than a thousand years.

12:28.380 --> 12:29.620
He could not have waited until now

12:29.620 --> 12:32.080
if he had already got a different intention.

12:52.580 --> 12:54.060
Such a strong demon aura.

12:55.060 --> 12:57.740
How many years have you colluded with the Demons?

12:57.740 --> 12:58.620
It looks like

12:58.980 --> 13:00.610
it has been more than ten years.

13:00.610 --> 13:01.100
No.

13:01.180 --> 13:02.900
I didn't.

13:05.460 --> 13:07.060
Who is it

13:08.260 --> 13:09.780
that you colluded with?

13:09.780 --> 13:10.690
I don't know.

13:11.420 --> 13:13.340
Your qualifications and cultivation are above mine.

13:13.340 --> 13:13.700
Why would you...

13:13.700 --> 13:14.260
Yeah!

13:15.740 --> 13:16.770
I also want to know

13:17.340 --> 13:18.470
why someone like you

13:18.700 --> 13:21.160
could become the Master of the Palace Wuxie.

13:21.500 --> 13:23.830
You did all this for such a trivial matter?

13:27.620 --> 13:28.740
A trivial matter?

13:33.700 --> 13:34.860
I, Xie Lingqi,

13:35.020 --> 13:36.580
have been working hard for so long

13:36.580 --> 13:38.740
to help the Three Realms of Immortal Palace.

13:38.740 --> 13:41.540
I have participated in more than a thousand campaigns

13:41.540 --> 13:43.180
and more than ten thousand

13:43.540 --> 13:44.380
battles

13:44.660 --> 13:47.020
to protect Immortal Palace's Regulation.

13:47.020 --> 13:47.980
I've had more injuries

13:47.980 --> 13:49.540
than I can count.

13:54.700 --> 13:55.820
But in the end,

13:56.100 --> 13:57.620
I couldn't even compare with that pompous

13:57.620 --> 13:59.650
Shang Yurong.

14:06.100 --> 14:06.860
And you.

14:07.820 --> 14:08.660
I got this new scar

14:08.660 --> 14:10.920
to protect you when Luo Ge was in retreat.

14:11.500 --> 14:13.830
You haven't forgotten all that, have you?

14:15.860 --> 14:16.940
All of you

14:17.180 --> 14:19.180
are just staying out of this matter.

14:20.620 --> 14:22.020
How many of you are like me

14:22.820 --> 14:24.500
who fought hard on the blood-soaked battlefield

14:24.500 --> 14:27.140
to get where I am now?

14:29.940 --> 14:32.400
So someone used the resentment in your heart

14:32.700 --> 14:35.340
to infuse the demon aura into your heart step by step.

14:35.340 --> 14:37.470
I don't care why you colluded with him.

14:37.890 --> 14:40.090
You'll be a prisoner of Immortal Palace

14:40.260 --> 14:41.700
for the rest of your life.

14:42.380 --> 14:42.860
Guards!

14:43.180 --> 14:43.660
Yes.

14:44.260 --> 14:46.190
Put Xie Lingqi in Bone Melting Pool

14:46.780 --> 14:48.220
for eternity.

14:55.020 --> 14:56.350
I'll go there by myself.

15:19.100 --> 15:20.780
So, you and Luo Ge

15:21.170 --> 15:24.260
set this all up together?

15:37.350 --> 15:38.650
Hush.

15:39.260 --> 15:41.060
You've been acting with Luo Ge

15:42.300 --> 15:44.100
since the conferring ceremony.

15:45.180 --> 15:47.440
Although Luo Ning said you were useless,

15:48.260 --> 15:50.300
the person who set this up with Luo Ge

15:51.100 --> 15:53.260
could never be useless.

15:53.740 --> 15:54.570
Now you know

15:54.570 --> 15:56.100
how important I am.

15:56.780 --> 15:58.570
I didn't treat you unfairly.

15:58.660 --> 16:00.620
I got a lot of energy cultivation pills from Luo Ge

16:00.620 --> 16:02.100
for you.

16:02.500 --> 16:03.140
Look at you.

16:03.140 --> 16:04.650
You look much better.

16:06.180 --> 16:07.900
That's because I was useful.

16:09.220 --> 16:11.940
Not only could I help you make the talisman pearl,

16:11.940 --> 16:14.460
but I could also be your bait.

16:15.740 --> 16:17.500
Don't blame it all on Luo Ge.

16:18.090 --> 16:20.780
You were not the only one he was cruel to.

16:20.900 --> 16:22.900
He was more cruel to himself.

16:23.340 --> 16:24.660
In order to experience hardships in the mortal world,

16:24.660 --> 16:26.120
he sealed his five senses,

16:26.380 --> 16:28.240
and even removed half of his heart

16:28.260 --> 16:29.380
to fall into the mortal world.

16:29.380 --> 16:30.620
He has suffered so much more

16:30.620 --> 16:31.660
than you've done

16:31.860 --> 16:33.980
in refining of Blood Amulet.

16:34.780 --> 16:35.740
So tell me,

16:35.940 --> 16:37.100
for a ruthless person like him,

16:37.100 --> 16:38.860
is he good or evil?

16:38.980 --> 16:41.140
All he gets is what he wants.

16:41.740 --> 16:43.140
The tragic ending of Lu Li

16:43.660 --> 16:46.420
is just a tribulation for him to become an Immortal.

16:46.420 --> 16:47.300
Others,

16:48.100 --> 16:50.140
even if they fell into hell for eternity,

16:50.140 --> 16:51.420
they would still just be an insignificant detail

16:51.420 --> 16:52.660
in this tribulation.

16:52.660 --> 16:54.390
They can be ignored at any time.

16:54.780 --> 16:55.620
Why?

16:59.460 --> 17:01.540
You rushed back to check the injury of Miss Liu

17:01.540 --> 17:04.470
after dealing with the matter of the spy, didn't you?

17:08.819 --> 17:09.880
I'll go back first.

17:11.099 --> 17:12.089
Liu Shao.

17:13.619 --> 17:15.380
Can you take it

17:16.660 --> 17:19.119
if I ask you to take two more talisman pearls?

17:19.780 --> 17:20.910
Why should I do this?

17:21.740 --> 17:23.140
After you trampled on my heart,

17:23.140 --> 17:25.140
I still need to dedicate my body

17:25.579 --> 17:26.859
to fulfill your honorable reputation

17:26.859 --> 17:28.540
of guarding the Three Realms?

17:29.860 --> 17:31.190
Do you ever feel guilty?

17:35.980 --> 17:36.740
Yes, I do.

17:37.980 --> 17:39.440
But I have to make my choice

17:40.900 --> 17:42.500
since I have responsibility.

17:42.500 --> 17:43.960
Sacrifice yourself then.

17:44.020 --> 17:46.780
Sacrifice yourself to fill that Four Seasons Monument.

17:46.780 --> 17:48.580
Why do you expect a mortal like me

17:48.660 --> 17:50.260
to sacrifice my body, my mind

17:50.900 --> 17:52.020
and even my life?

17:53.500 --> 17:54.630
Why should I do this?

18:22.460 --> 18:23.970
Sacrifice yourself then.

18:23.970 --> 18:26.820
Sacrifice yourself to fill that Four Seasons Monument.

18:26.820 --> 18:28.620
Why do you expect a mortal like me

18:28.700 --> 18:30.360
to sacrifice my body, my mind,

18:30.940 --> 18:31.930
and even my life?

18:35.460 --> 18:36.570
As long as I'm here,

18:37.100 --> 18:38.430
you will never come out,

18:40.060 --> 18:42.260
even without the blood talisman pearl.

18:53.260 --> 18:53.940
Ge,

18:54.210 --> 18:56.500
The Four Seasons Monument hasn't been fully restored yet.

18:56.500 --> 18:58.500
Why did you remove the magic circle?

18:58.500 --> 19:00.660
Liu Shao has taken out four talisman pearls,

19:00.660 --> 19:03.580
and restored more than half of the Four Seasons Monument.

19:03.580 --> 19:04.900
She has done enough.

19:05.460 --> 19:08.540
Since there's a chance to restore the Four Seasons Monument completely,

19:08.540 --> 19:09.620
why did you give up?

19:09.620 --> 19:11.020
Have you forgotten about

19:11.340 --> 19:13.600
what was suppressed under the monument?

19:20.690 --> 19:23.090
It was half of God of the Moonlight's heart.

19:27.210 --> 19:28.050
Back then,

19:28.180 --> 19:29.820
the Three Realms were in chaos,

19:29.820 --> 19:31.420
and the demonic aura arises.

19:32.020 --> 19:34.940
In order to protect the worlds,

19:35.140 --> 19:37.820
the God of the Moonlights sealed the demonic aura by himself.

19:37.820 --> 19:38.940
But unexpectedly,

19:39.380 --> 19:42.460
that demonic aura has formed a mind and turned into an evil creature.

19:42.460 --> 19:44.740
It controlled God of the Moonlight.

19:45.940 --> 19:48.780
The God of the Sun had to kill him

19:49.140 --> 19:51.860
and suppressed the corrupted half of his heart

19:51.980 --> 19:54.460
under the Four Seasons Monument.

19:54.660 --> 19:57.940
And you were born of the other pure part of his heart.

19:58.140 --> 20:00.940
You should know what your mission is.

20:01.220 --> 20:03.140
Now, the Four Seasons Monument is turbulent.

20:03.140 --> 20:04.020
The demonic creature under the monument

20:04.020 --> 20:06.350
could come out anytime to harm all beings.

20:06.740 --> 20:07.300
Ge,

20:08.420 --> 20:10.020
you can't miss any chance

20:10.020 --> 20:12.260
to eliminate the hidden danger.

20:13.900 --> 20:16.100
The best way to eliminate the hidden danger

20:16.100 --> 20:18.160
is to become a God as soon as possible.

20:18.380 --> 20:20.620
But I failed this woman during my tribulation.

20:20.620 --> 20:23.020
If I used her once again as a stepping stone,

20:23.620 --> 20:25.020
it would harm my morality

20:26.380 --> 20:28.020
and be bad for me to become a God.

20:28.020 --> 20:28.820
But,

20:29.660 --> 20:31.140
she is a mortal after all.

20:31.500 --> 20:33.160
A mortal is also a human being.

20:35.180 --> 20:35.980
Moreover,

20:37.540 --> 20:39.870
how could someone possessed by Sun Spirit

20:40.380 --> 20:41.660
be an ordinary person?

20:44.260 --> 20:45.260
Immortal Master,

20:45.940 --> 20:47.070
listen to my advice.

20:47.740 --> 20:49.070
Don't push her anymore.

20:49.300 --> 20:50.900
What if she helps the Demons?

20:51.540 --> 20:52.220
Ge,

20:52.900 --> 20:53.820
do not forget

20:54.260 --> 20:55.450
that so far she hasn't told us

20:55.450 --> 20:58.300
about the origin of that demon string.

21:09.780 --> 21:11.440
Greetings, Immortal Master.

21:12.100 --> 21:15.020
You've been here for a while, right?

21:15.260 --> 21:15.860
Yes.

21:16.340 --> 21:18.100
What do you want from Immortal Palace?

21:18.100 --> 21:20.230
I've always admired Immortal Palace.

21:20.250 --> 21:21.980
I want to stay here to cultivate

21:22.300 --> 21:23.960
and protect the Three Realms.

21:25.660 --> 21:27.020
Was it out of kindness when

21:27.020 --> 21:30.130
you saved the lower-level disciple of Immortal Palace

21:30.860 --> 21:32.650
the other day?

21:33.740 --> 21:35.260
Since I've been cultivating myself,

21:35.260 --> 21:37.590
saving people is just an instinct of mine.

21:39.340 --> 21:41.600
You were the disciple of Marquis Wuyang,

21:41.690 --> 21:43.180
and senior of Lu Li.

21:44.340 --> 21:47.700
You were deprived of direct discipleship because of Liu Shao,

21:47.700 --> 21:49.980
so you hold a grudge against her.

21:50.020 --> 21:51.900
The reason why you saved people in the immortal world

21:51.900 --> 21:53.020
was just to

21:53.140 --> 21:56.000
stay in Immortal Palace to take revenge on Liu Shao.

21:56.340 --> 21:57.460
Am I right?

21:57.580 --> 21:58.980
Immortal Master, I...

22:08.060 --> 22:08.940
Take it.

22:20.140 --> 22:22.620
Do you know what I gave you?

22:23.140 --> 22:24.180
I don't think

22:24.380 --> 22:25.780
I should ask you about it.

22:27.420 --> 22:30.550
It is the Golden Pill that can improve your cultivation.

22:31.020 --> 22:32.780
From today onwards,

22:32.900 --> 22:34.760
I need you to go to Xiyin Mountain,

22:34.780 --> 22:36.340
and protect Luo Ge for me.

22:36.620 --> 22:38.060
Protect Immortal Luo Ge?

22:38.820 --> 22:40.380
Are you willing to

22:40.380 --> 22:42.510
see Liu Shao arouse Luo Ge's feelings,

22:42.660 --> 22:45.660
and then they finally become a couple?

22:45.980 --> 22:46.810
No, I'm not.

22:49.540 --> 22:50.300
Fine.

22:50.900 --> 22:52.540
Then I'm counting on you.

22:53.260 --> 22:55.740
You're only allowed to stop them from being together.

22:55.740 --> 22:57.500
Don't do anything stupid.

22:57.940 --> 22:59.800
Otherwise, you will be punished.

22:59.980 --> 23:00.900
Yes.

23:03.460 --> 23:04.220
Liu Shao,

23:04.220 --> 23:05.620
can you stop crying?

23:05.700 --> 23:06.380
How many tears

23:06.380 --> 23:07.860
have you shed today?

23:07.980 --> 23:08.420
Even my leaves

23:08.420 --> 23:10.480
are pickled by the salt in your tears.

23:11.020 --> 23:13.550
Then why are you walking around in front of me?

23:14.060 --> 23:15.700
I'm just worried about you.

23:16.300 --> 23:18.220
There's nothing good about Immortal Palace.

23:18.220 --> 23:20.260
It's not even as good as the Pearl Pavilion.

23:20.260 --> 23:21.690
At least when I closed my eyes,

23:21.690 --> 23:24.740
I would see Ling Xueyang smile at me.

23:24.900 --> 23:25.700
You are right.

23:26.260 --> 23:27.740
What's so good about here?

23:28.500 --> 23:29.740
Everytime I opened my eyes,

23:29.740 --> 23:32.270
I would see someone with the same face as Lu Li.

23:32.460 --> 23:33.720
But every words he said

23:33.940 --> 23:35.220
were like knives

23:35.940 --> 23:37.740
that stabbed my heart.

23:39.900 --> 23:41.030
I've figured it out.

23:42.220 --> 23:43.060
Perhaps...

23:44.860 --> 23:46.220
he's not Lu Li at all.

23:46.980 --> 23:49.710
He's just a jerk who stole the appearance of Lu Li.

23:52.940 --> 23:54.690
Liu Shao, did you notice that...

23:54.690 --> 23:56.140
the immortals in Immortal Palace

23:56.140 --> 23:59.000
always like to appear and disappear mysteriously?

24:00.180 --> 24:01.580
I'll visit you later.

24:03.020 --> 24:03.820
Yes.

24:04.770 --> 24:06.700
I wonder what kind of Immortal

24:07.140 --> 24:09.340
would always eavesdrop behind others.

24:09.740 --> 24:11.050
Lu Li wouldn't do that.

24:12.900 --> 24:13.580
Lu Li

24:14.180 --> 24:16.040
used to call himself an Immortal.

24:16.940 --> 24:18.580
But he was a liar.

24:19.500 --> 24:20.760
We promised each other

24:21.300 --> 24:23.580
that we would only be mortals for a lifetime,

24:23.580 --> 24:27.310
instead of being immortals with loneliness of thousands of years.

24:54.220 --> 24:56.140
I'm afraid I can't return the Bone-Corroding Harp to you

24:56.140 --> 24:58.470
because it was connected by demon string.

24:58.820 --> 25:01.350
Take this ice string zither as compensation.

25:01.580 --> 25:03.810
You can learn this Great Tone and Six Senses Symphony first,

25:03.810 --> 25:06.260
if you have time.

25:06.980 --> 25:09.340
It can help you calm your mind down.

25:10.180 --> 25:12.440
I can teach you if you have any questions.

25:13.690 --> 25:14.420
So,

25:14.900 --> 25:16.540
the reason why you gave me the zither

25:16.540 --> 25:17.450
and music score

25:18.580 --> 25:20.310
was just to make me forget about

25:20.700 --> 25:22.460
my relationship with Lu Li.

25:26.380 --> 25:29.180
It's your call if you want to keep that memory.

25:35.540 --> 25:36.140
Okay.

25:37.300 --> 25:38.260
I will forget.

25:38.940 --> 25:42.540
I'll forget about everything since I met you at Immortal Palace,

25:42.860 --> 25:44.590
and keep what you've forgotten

25:45.540 --> 25:47.090
in my mind.

26:19.020 --> 26:20.860
They are playing the zither together.

26:20.860 --> 26:22.100
Interesting.

26:22.580 --> 26:23.820
Then they are not far

26:24.100 --> 26:25.740
from falling in love, right?

26:40.780 --> 26:42.500
Where have I heard this song?

26:44.500 --> 26:45.090
This is

26:46.940 --> 26:49.200
the sound of the Brahma tree blossoming.

26:52.180 --> 26:53.540
Brahma tree?

26:55.140 --> 26:56.340
Was it Aquatic Demons

26:57.420 --> 27:00.020
who repaired the Bone-Corroding Harp for you?

27:00.620 --> 27:01.300
Yes.

27:26.690 --> 27:28.490
Liu Shao, you're finally awake.

27:34.100 --> 27:35.340
How did I fall asleep?

27:35.620 --> 27:37.140
Wasn't I playing the zither with him?

27:37.140 --> 27:40.020
You seem to have betrayed He Na just now.

27:56.220 --> 27:58.020
Where is the Demon King in White?

27:58.940 --> 28:01.060
It is Luo Ge from Xiyin Mountain.

28:01.260 --> 28:01.980
Luo Ge?

28:04.780 --> 28:05.860
I'll go meet him.

28:06.170 --> 28:07.340
Don't you go out.

28:18.740 --> 28:19.410
Lu Li?

28:19.820 --> 28:20.940
I'm Luo Ge,

28:21.980 --> 28:23.180
from Xiyin Mountain.

28:24.260 --> 28:25.020
Luo Ge?

28:29.420 --> 28:31.170
We Aquatic Demons live underwater

28:31.170 --> 28:32.700
and don't ask about the outside world.

28:32.700 --> 28:33.940
Immortal Luo Ge,

28:34.380 --> 28:35.580
tell me why you're here.

28:35.580 --> 28:36.860
I'm here

28:37.490 --> 28:39.260
to ask you something.

28:44.380 --> 28:45.710
Did you give this string

28:45.980 --> 28:47.620
to Liu Shao?

28:48.660 --> 28:49.300
Yes.

28:51.700 --> 28:53.250
You created chaos in Immortal Palace

28:53.250 --> 28:55.100
and caused many innocent deaths.

28:55.100 --> 28:57.380
The Four Seasons Monument got unstable and the three worlds were in danger.

28:57.380 --> 28:58.060
He Na,

28:59.260 --> 29:00.740
You are unforgivable.

29:07.060 --> 29:08.060
Fu.

29:17.210 --> 29:17.820
Stop!

29:25.260 --> 29:26.320
He Na, are you okay?

29:27.260 --> 29:27.820
I'm fine.

29:30.180 --> 29:32.100
The reason why you gave me ice string zither,

29:32.100 --> 29:33.020
talked to me about the past,

29:33.020 --> 29:34.220
and let my guard down,

29:34.340 --> 29:36.260
was to get me to betray He Na.

29:39.140 --> 29:40.340
I just need the truth.

29:43.940 --> 29:46.180
The truth is he did give me the string.

29:46.740 --> 29:48.000
But he did it to save me,

29:48.420 --> 29:49.330
not to use me.

29:49.580 --> 29:50.140
So,

29:51.740 --> 29:53.740
you'd rather believe the words from a demon,

29:53.740 --> 29:54.260
right?

29:56.420 --> 29:57.820
If you were Lu Li,

29:58.500 --> 29:59.960
you would believe him too.

30:00.740 --> 30:02.000
Not only did he save me,

30:02.500 --> 30:03.560
he also saved Lu Li,

30:04.460 --> 30:05.500
again and again.

30:08.500 --> 30:10.630
The demon string came from Demon King.

30:10.940 --> 30:12.540
You can't deny this, can you?

30:13.580 --> 30:15.700
Even if the matter was not related to you,

30:15.700 --> 30:18.030
it was at least related to the demon world.

30:18.980 --> 30:20.220
I'll give you one day

30:21.220 --> 30:22.420
to find out the truth.

30:25.940 --> 30:28.060
I've cast Protection Spell around your palace.

30:28.060 --> 30:28.850
In one day,

30:29.460 --> 30:30.060
no one

30:31.340 --> 30:32.700
is allowed to leave.

30:46.340 --> 30:47.860
In order to find out the truth,

30:47.860 --> 30:48.860
you need to know

30:49.100 --> 30:51.030
what happened that day at Lusitai.

31:27.620 --> 31:28.420
Brahma tree,

31:29.940 --> 31:31.470
if you dare to shake my mind,

31:32.460 --> 31:34.920
don't blame me for ruining your foundation.

31:37.380 --> 31:39.140
That's what happened.

31:39.740 --> 31:41.620
When I was fixing the Four Seasons Monument,

31:41.620 --> 31:44.420
I felt that the string were controled by others,

31:45.180 --> 31:46.660
instead of me.

31:47.620 --> 31:48.660
That's why

31:48.900 --> 31:50.820
the Immortal Palace Boundary was destroyed,

31:50.820 --> 31:52.750
and demons made a lot of mess there.

31:54.780 --> 31:55.980
Lu Li protected us.

31:58.340 --> 31:59.870
But I failed to protect him.

32:05.620 --> 32:06.480
I didn't expect

32:07.540 --> 32:08.260
this Immortal

32:08.260 --> 32:10.260
looks exactly like Lu Li.

32:10.780 --> 32:11.700
He is Lu Li.

32:12.380 --> 32:14.110
He has just forgetten the past.

32:15.420 --> 32:16.210
Or maybe,

32:17.100 --> 32:18.140
Lu Li

32:18.380 --> 32:19.860
is an insignificant existence

32:19.860 --> 32:21.500
in his thousand-year life,

32:22.660 --> 32:23.860
just like dust,

32:24.300 --> 32:25.830
can be slapped away easily.

32:25.980 --> 32:26.980
Immortal Luo Ge

32:29.340 --> 32:31.330
is famous for being heartless.

32:33.300 --> 32:34.740
But I don't understand.

32:35.300 --> 32:37.540
Since Immortal Luo Ge is heartless,

32:37.820 --> 32:39.380
why would he turn into that sentimental Lu Li

32:39.380 --> 32:40.700
when he came to the mortal world

32:40.700 --> 32:42.360
to overcome his tribulation?

32:44.020 --> 32:44.620
Liu Shao.

32:46.420 --> 32:47.090
Sometimes,

32:47.900 --> 32:48.780
persistence

32:50.140 --> 32:51.730
may only hurt you.

33:00.060 --> 33:01.190
I'm not persistent.

33:01.660 --> 33:02.620
All I care about

33:02.940 --> 33:03.900
is Lu Li,

33:04.780 --> 33:06.650
not this heartless Luo Ge.

33:14.940 --> 33:15.620
Now,

33:16.380 --> 33:17.940
he forced you to look for the truth.

33:17.940 --> 33:19.140
Do you have any clues?

33:22.180 --> 33:23.510
We can only declare that

33:24.020 --> 33:25.980
we found Immortal Ze Shui's hair.

33:26.420 --> 33:27.340
We can't  tell him

33:27.340 --> 33:29.420
that our spiritual veins can be replaced.

33:29.420 --> 33:32.050
If something happens to Bone-Corroding Harp again,

33:32.050 --> 33:33.460
they will come back to us.

33:34.570 --> 33:35.970
You are powerful enough.

33:36.900 --> 33:38.430
But I can't take it any more.

33:38.660 --> 33:40.120
One more extraction might

33:42.570 --> 33:44.020
take my life.

33:45.860 --> 33:47.520
I didn't recall anything yet.

33:48.940 --> 33:50.140
Let me think about it.

33:57.220 --> 33:58.350
Do you have any wine?

34:01.490 --> 34:02.090
Of course.

34:02.500 --> 34:04.360
I'll ask someone to give it to you.

34:26.340 --> 34:27.219
Prove it.

34:31.659 --> 34:32.500
Prove what?

34:32.739 --> 34:35.139
Prove that you're no longer Lu Li, a mortal.

34:38.100 --> 34:39.179
It was under this tree

34:39.179 --> 34:40.739
that day,

34:41.139 --> 34:42.940
where Lu Li told me those sincere words after he was drunk,

34:42.940 --> 34:44.940
and made me a promise for a lifetime.

34:47.179 --> 34:48.219
Madam,

34:48.580 --> 34:49.739
you once bloomed ten thousand flowers

34:49.739 --> 34:51.380
to witness it for us, right?

35:12.220 --> 35:13.460
What are you doing?

35:13.900 --> 35:15.260
Now you are even interfering with

35:15.260 --> 35:16.460
the feeling of a tree?

35:17.340 --> 35:18.460
It was too noisy.

35:19.420 --> 35:20.820
You are afraid to face it,

35:22.620 --> 35:24.140
or drink this wine.

35:22.630 --> 35:28.910
♫In the sea of clouds, I looked at the reflection of the moon in the water♫

35:24.580 --> 35:25.460
You're afraid that after drinking it,

35:25.460 --> 35:27.140
you would become Lu Li again.

35:31.240 --> 35:35.480
♫I kept waiting and arched my palms into a circle♫

35:31.980 --> 35:33.420
Lu Li no longer exists.

35:36.900 --> 35:42.910
♫The reflection gradually reminded me of our first meeting♫

35:40.180 --> 35:41.340
Prove it to me then.

35:42.820 --> 35:44.100
Even if you are an Immortal,

35:43.790 --> 35:48.900
♫I can no longer tell the difference between wind and rain♫

35:44.850 --> 35:46.250
you can't change the fact

35:46.460 --> 35:48.060
that you have stepped on my sincere heart

35:48.060 --> 35:49.220
on your way

35:49.220 --> 35:50.620
to become an Immortal.

35:50.300 --> 35:53.790
♫Even if I get the volley sword♫

35:52.410 --> 35:52.980
Luo Ge.

35:54.320 --> 35:57.930
♫I can't forget you♫

35:54.420 --> 35:55.420
You owe me.

35:57.930 --> 36:01.580
♫Our destiny has been sealed long ago♫

36:01.750 --> 36:04.400
♫I have no other choice♫

36:04.400 --> 36:08.120
♫Why have you been so far away from me every time♫

36:08.120 --> 36:10.650
♫For billions of years♫

36:11.290 --> 36:15.180
♫Can I use your hands to warm up the world again?♫

36:15.180 --> 36:17.630
♫A few hasty nights♫

36:15.300 --> 36:17.100
I told you Lu Li no longer exists.

36:17.620 --> 36:18.890
I'm still Luo Ge.

36:18.470 --> 36:22.200
♫Too many intertwined oaths and lies♫

36:20.140 --> 36:21.340
Nothing has changed.

36:22.200 --> 36:25.360
♫Have shattered my dreams♫

36:25.600 --> 36:29.680
♫Who would like to take a broken willow branch♫

36:29.680 --> 36:32.260
♫And watch the moon alone in the blue sky♫

36:47.290 --> 36:53.910
♫The remaining flowers in the mirror reflect the moon in the water♫

36:48.300 --> 36:48.980
Yes,

36:50.340 --> 36:51.600
Lu Li no longer exists.

36:55.710 --> 36:59.960
♫We can't live up to such a good time♫

37:01.420 --> 37:08.040
♫Recalling the unforgettable glance at the beginning♫

37:08.430 --> 37:12.000
♫I realized that it was a thousand years ago♫

37:12.000 --> 37:14.820
♫Is this bad luck, or good luck?♫

37:12.660 --> 37:13.500
So...

37:14.780 --> 37:16.780
the face that looked exactly like Lu Li,

37:15.060 --> 37:18.530
♫He said that responsibility and love are difficult to balance♫

37:18.260 --> 37:20.250
and the way he looked at me once in a while,

37:18.530 --> 37:21.010
♫He had no choice but to leave me♫

37:21.260 --> 37:22.460
were all faked.

37:22.040 --> 37:25.670
♫The past has passed, do not linger♫

37:23.940 --> 37:25.900
Even if he has Lu Li's heart,

37:25.670 --> 37:28.620
♫My love for you is still so strong♫

37:26.700 --> 37:28.060
he's not Lu Li.

37:29.010 --> 37:32.760
♫Too many intertwined oaths and lies♫

37:29.500 --> 37:30.740
Lu Li

37:31.660 --> 37:33.060
is really gone.

37:32.760 --> 37:36.180
♫Have shattered my dreams♫

37:36.180 --> 37:41.080
♫Who would like to take a broken willow branch♫

37:44.110 --> 37:46.700
♫And watch the moon alone in the blue sky♫

37:53.020 --> 37:53.820
What's wrong?

37:54.460 --> 37:56.520
Why do you have that look on your face?

38:02.460 --> 38:04.260
So it was you behind

38:04.620 --> 38:06.460
all those incidents on Lusitai.

38:07.930 --> 38:09.500
You had planed everything

38:10.100 --> 38:12.220
when you gave up the spirit vein.

38:14.500 --> 38:16.180
Do you think I did anything wrong?

38:16.180 --> 38:18.510
Do you still think you did the right thing?

38:23.460 --> 38:25.460
Do you know how many people have died

38:26.340 --> 38:27.620
in that battle?

38:27.620 --> 38:28.780
Of course I know.

38:29.900 --> 38:30.540
Even the great demon Ao Hen,

38:30.540 --> 38:32.820
who was your only opponent in the demon world,

38:32.820 --> 38:34.100
has died over there.

38:35.580 --> 38:36.860
Isn't it good for us

38:36.860 --> 38:37.780
to rule the entire demon world?

38:37.780 --> 38:38.900
So what?

38:39.420 --> 38:40.950
Can we set our feet on shore?

38:41.380 --> 38:42.340
So...

38:43.820 --> 38:45.700
so we need to break the curse.

38:46.900 --> 38:48.630
But have you ever thought about

38:49.500 --> 38:51.850
what will happen

38:52.260 --> 38:55.790
if that evil creature under Four Seasons Monument is released?

38:55.980 --> 38:57.180
I thought it through.

38:57.820 --> 38:59.740
It might cause chaos to the three worlds,

38:59.740 --> 39:01.660
or bring trouble to all living beings.

39:01.660 --> 39:02.740
But so what?

39:04.220 --> 39:05.750
As long as we break the curse

39:06.460 --> 39:08.020
to free the Aquatic Demons,

39:08.420 --> 39:09.700
so that we can walk freely

39:09.700 --> 39:10.740
under the sun,

39:11.170 --> 39:12.180
anything

39:12.540 --> 39:13.600
is worth the price.

39:16.380 --> 39:17.420
As the Demon King,

39:18.420 --> 39:21.140
no one wants to relieve the suffering of my people more than I do.

39:21.140 --> 39:21.860
But it shouldn't

39:21.860 --> 39:23.620
be based on other people's suffering.

39:23.620 --> 39:24.340
No.

39:26.380 --> 39:27.300
You're wrong.

39:29.260 --> 39:31.570
As long as our people are no longer in pain,

39:31.570 --> 39:32.380
then

39:33.100 --> 39:34.380
any sacrifice

39:34.700 --> 39:35.770
is worth it,

39:37.180 --> 39:38.580
including my life

39:39.020 --> 39:39.780
and

39:42.220 --> 39:43.300
your life.

39:45.940 --> 39:47.340
But did those sacrifices

39:48.060 --> 39:49.390
get you what you wanted?

39:50.580 --> 39:53.180
Or was it for a greater sacrifice of our people?

39:54.860 --> 39:56.220
If Immortal Luo Ge get angry,

39:56.220 --> 39:58.180
It will be a slaughter inside this palace.

39:58.180 --> 40:00.180
How can we stop him if that happens?

40:00.420 --> 40:00.980
Fine.

40:02.100 --> 40:04.100
Since you think what I did was wrong,

40:04.740 --> 40:06.540
I'll take the responsibility.

40:13.980 --> 40:16.510
I do not judge the right or wrong of what you do.

40:17.340 --> 40:17.980
Fu,

40:19.620 --> 40:21.020
you've suffered so much.

40:22.180 --> 40:24.540
It's me who failed to protect you.

40:59.900 --> 41:01.100
Madam,

41:03.220 --> 41:04.940
do you remember

41:06.580 --> 41:08.340
he told me...

41:10.100 --> 41:10.930
I said

41:11.940 --> 41:13.890
that lifetime is long.

41:14.100 --> 41:16.020
What if I can't afford you?

41:18.020 --> 41:19.060
He said to me,

41:20.220 --> 41:21.450
I'll sell myself to you.

41:21.450 --> 41:22.710
I'll sell myself to you

41:23.060 --> 41:24.820
-for one tael of silver. -One tael of silver.

41:24.820 --> 41:25.620
-Okay? -Okay?

41:27.740 --> 41:28.980
One tael of silver.
